stateDiagram-v2
    %% CURRENT implementation; sources and guards in transition inventory.
    state "pending" as pending
    state "consumed" as consumed
    [*] --> pending
    pending --> consumed: consume_result!
    pending --> consumed: consume_registration_result! after verified Source binding and audit commit
    consumed --> [*]
    note right of pending
        Auth signed result crosses to Base credential commit.
        TTL/refusal has no stored expired, failed or canceled status.
        Ticket consumption and principal commit need not be one DB transaction.
        Original settings proof stays bounded and immutable in Source.
        Source binding failure preserves the pending Ticket; receipt failure
        reconciles only its original Source binding and audit operation.
    end note
